OL,3,GNEWSAM27 junction upgrade set to open
OL,4,Aahead of schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major motorway upgrade expected to
OL,7,Fcarry about 30,000 vehicles a day is
OL,8,Fset to open months earlier than
OL,9,Fplanned.
OL,11,FThe improved M27 Junction 10 in
OL,12,FHampshire will begin opening in phases
OL,13,Ffrom 14 September, with new slip roads,
OL,14,Fan underpass and four roundabouts
OL,15,Fcoming into use.
OL,17,FThe scheme will eventually provide full
OL,18,Faccess to and from the motorway in both
OL,19,Fdirections and is seen as key to
OL,20,Funlocking up to 6,000 planned homes.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
